ance","saldo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["fifty","dollars","Yes"],"ans":"Yes fifty dollars","pt":"Sim, cinquenta dólares."},{"words":["show","your","ID","You","must"],"ans":"You must show your ID","pt":"Você precisa mostrar seu documento."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"account","pos":"word","pt":"conta","ex":"A new account.","expt":"Uma conta nova."},{"w":"PIN","pos":"word","pt":"senha do cartão","ex":"A secret PIN.","expt":"Uma senha secreta."},{"w":"teller","pos":"word","pt":"atendente de banco","ex":"The teller helps.","expt":"O atendente ajuda."},{"w":"booking","pos":"word","pt":"booking","ex":"reserva","expt":"An online booking."},{"w":"confirmation","pos":"word","pt":"confirmation","ex":"confirmação","expt":"An email confirmation."},{"w":"availability","pos":"word","pt":"availability","ex":"disponibilidade","expt":"Check availability."},{"w":"waiting list","pos":"word","pt":"waiting list","ex":"lista de espera","expt":"On the waiting list."},{"w":"queue number","pos":"word","pt":"queue number","ex":"senha de atendimento","expt":"Take a queue number."},{"w":"withdrawal","pos":"word","pt":"withdrawal","ex":"saque","expt":"A cash withdrawal."},{"w":"loan","pos":"word","pt":"loan","ex":"empréstimo","expt":"Apply for a loan."},{"w":"fee","pos":"word","pt":"fee","ex":"taxa","expt":"A small fee."},{"w":"postage","pos":"word","pt":"postage","ex":"postagem","expt":"Postage is extra."},{"w":"registered mail","pos":"word","pt":"registered mail","ex":"correspondência registrada","expt":"Send registered mail."},{"w":"haircut","pos":"word","pt":"haircut","ex":"corte de cabelo","expt":"A quick haircut."},{"w":"trim","pos":"word","pt":"trim","ex":"aparar","expt":"A small trim."},{"w":"manicure","pos":"word","pt":"manicure","ex":"manicure","expt":"Get a manicure."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**You must show your ID.** — Você precisa mostrar seu documento.","**Do I have to make a deposit?** — Preciso fazer um depósito?","**Yes, fifty dollars.** — Sim, cinquenta dólares.","**Speaking of which…** — Por falar nisso…","**Before I forget…** — Antes que eu esqueça…","**By the way, did you hear…?** — A propósito, você soube…?","**Guess what!** — Adivinhe só!"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"add","pt":"adicionar","forms":[["I / you / we / they add","I add salt."],["he / she / it adds","She adds sugar."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the bank","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the bank","lines":[["Teller","You must show your ID.","Você precisa mostrar seu documento."],["Ana","Do I have to make a deposit?","Preciso fazer um depósito?"],["Teller","Yes, fifty dollars.","Sim, cinquenta dólares."],["Ana","And what should I do next?","E o que devo fazer depois?"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","items":[{"label":"gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","note":"Na fala: going to → gonna, want to → wanna. Reconheça; na escrita use a forma completa.","words":["I’m gonna go","I wanna eat","What are you gonna do?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say a rule with must.","pt":"Diga.","model":"You must show your ID."},{"q":"Say a necessity with have to.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I have to pay a fee."},{"q":"Give advice with should.","pt":"Aconselhe.","model":"You should keep your PIN secret."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with modals about a bank.","model":"You must show your ID. You have to make a deposit. You should keep your PIN secret. You could set up a profile. I had to wait.","checklist":["Usei **4 modais**","Usei **had to**","Verbo base"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check you